# TCP Redis connection string (redis:// or rediss://) required by BullMQ
# (src/lib/bullmq/*). Different from UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL above -- BullMQ
# needs a real Redis TCP endpoint, e.g. Upstash's "Redis" connection string
# (not its REST URL), or any other managed Redis. Also required by the
# separate worker process (npm run worker / src/worker.ts) that actually
# consumes these queues -- see docs/INCIDENT_LOG.md for why this matters.
REDIS_URL=
